"""Email setup guide — Gmail or another provider, not a naked vendor page.

Dock “Gmail” / Mail should mean *how email works here*, then open the
inbox you actually use (Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo, iCloud, Proton, or Other).
AI only drafts; you always send.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

